# suite TCMDARG
ok 1 - a typical job stream line is parsed
ok 2 - the common keys are returned in their own fields
ok 3 - the leading program name is ignored
ok 4 - keys are folded to upper case
ok 5 - a quoted value may contain spaces
ok 6 - runs of spaces between arguments are tolerated
ok 7 - an empty command line is not an error
ok 8 - a key with an empty value is accepted
ok 9 - FROM and TO ranges are picked up
ok 10 - GET finds a key that was supplied
ok 11 - GET answers 16 for a key that was not supplied
ok 12 - GET is not case sensitive about the key
ok 13 - an argument without an = is rejected (CMD0001)
ok 14 - an empty key is rejected (CMD0002)
ok 15 - an unclosed quote is rejected (CMD0003)
ok 16 - an unknown function is rejected (CMD0009)
ok 17 - the run directory is taken from STERP_RUN
ok 18 - a spool file is named report-company-stamp.lst
ok 19 - the spool file sits in the spool folder
ok 20 - a Bacs file defaults to the txt extension
ok 21 - an MTD extract defaults to the json extension
ok 22 - the extension can be overridden
ok 23 - a fixed name can be built without a timestamp
ok 24 - the system clock fills a blank timestamp
ok 25 - an unknown folder is rejected (RUN0001)
ok 26 - a missing report id is rejected (RUN0002)
ok 27 - an unknown function is rejected (RUN0009)
1..27
# TCMDARG passed 00027 failed 00000
# exit 0
